WEBVTT

00:11:28.112 --> 00:11:30.413
Ultimately, the goal,

00:11:30.413 --> 00:11:34.612
once we understand how these subtle effects can change our decision making,

00:11:34.612 --> 00:11:37.562
we want to be able to provide people tools

00:11:37.562 --> 00:11:40.370
so that they can consciously make themselves better savers

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:43.629
and more conscious investors in their own future.

00:11:43.629 --> 00:11:45.896
Thank you very much.

00:11:45.896 --> 00:11:52.264
(Applause)